fixture telegraph_cue_keeps_its_word_through_hitstop
doc docs/adr/0013, the telegraph cue (task 6 review, M4): struck on frame 40, after its cue on 33, the dummy is held 2 f by the hit's hitstop but its swing is committed and still lands on 53, 20 ticks after the cue. Ash starts 12 u closer so side 1's recoil (60 u/s for 8 f after the hitstop, 8 u) leaves him inside the swing's reach. Before the cue a hit's hitstop delays both (telegraph_cue_waits_for_hitstop_before_it).
room test/dummy_swing
spawn 212 544
frames 60
input
  38 attack
end
expect
  at 33 event.telegraph_cue=1
  at 40 event.hit=1
  at 53 event.player_hit=1
end
